            "type": "wysiwyg",
            "tabs": "all",
            "toolbar": "basic",
            "media_upload": 0,
            "default_value": "Born from <strong>Amerta Jiwa Indonesia</strong>, Sandjong elevates wellness into a living ritual. The name Sandjong is inspired by the Indonesian word <strong>“sanjung”</strong>, meaning <strong>“praise”</strong> or <strong>“to bring joy”</strong> which reflects our devotion to heritage and balance. <br><br><strong>Rooted in Indonesia’s rich traditions</strong>, we reinterpret ancient wellness philosophies into refined, multisensory experiences, and create spaces to <strong>return home</strong> to: to calm, to culture, to self."
        },
