            "type": "wysiwyg",
            "tabs": "all",
            "toolbar": "basic",
            "media_upload": 0,
            "default_value": "Inspired by apothecaries of the past and royal sanctuaries of Southeast Asia, Sandjong is alive with texture, scent, and sound that relives that era. In Gading Serpong, Baduy serenity meets Peranakan spirit; in Jakarta, Javanese grace, Balinese warmth, and Peranakan elegance intertwine. From heirlooms to herbal blends, every detail invites you into a deeply sensory, culturally rooted escape."
