            "toolbar": "basic",
            "media_upload": 0,
            "default_value": "Every recognition we have received is not a trophy, but a whisper of gratitude—gently offered by those who have felt the calm, the comfort, and the culture within our sanctuary. These honors are not our destination. They are gentle markers along our path—reminders that grace, when given sincerely, often returns softly."
